      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BORROWED TIMES (1) finished fifth last time at this track but could not have been more impressive before that in his lightning 21.89 win at Gosford over 388m. Can measure up again if runs up to recent best times. TOP BIN NISMO (5) continues to race well, filling the minors at the last four starts, the latest at Gosford in 29.68. Tends to go well on this box draw. Super consistent and can feature with the right run. ARCHIE THOMAS (4) was strongly fancied latest and proved too good with a 1.75 lengths win at this track in a handy 22.88. Has a tricky draw to overcome but likes the trip. Got the money at his only try from this box. Can measure up again. HOT TO STOP (7) can fill a top-three spot.",
